# Render order and root nodes (a source reached twice through enumeration trees is flagged '*' = duplicated and becomes an extra root): channels in order; inactive/removed skipped; audio source outside any view still rendered but not a root; mix_audio=0 view contributes no roots; scene child shared with a direct channel is flagged duplicated and becomes a root.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
timeline 1000000000
source a input
source b input
source c input
source d input
source scene custom
source e input
source scene2 custom
child scene2 a
child scene a
child scene b
video_mix 1
video_mix 0
channel 0 0 scene
channel 0 1 a
channel 0 2 c
channel 0 3 d
channel 1 0 e
channel 1 1 scene2
set scene2 active 1
custom scene2 1 tick 0
set scene active 1
set a active 1
set b active 1
set c active 0
set d active 1
set d removed 1
set e active 1
custom scene 1 tick 0
run 1 1
set d removed 0
run 1 1
